  "releaseNotes": "Fixed UnsafeGet — descriptor.Offset is now added to _dataOffset, fixing multi-file archive reads;\n      Fixed Setup validation — IndexOfAny now uses >= 0 to catch invalid chars at position 0;\n      Added optional plaintext comment preamble (magic \"ARCH\" + flags + length-prefixed UTF-8 comment);\n      Added CRC32 integrity footer (\"CRCC\") with automatic verification on load;\n      Refactored preamble-skip logic into shared internal SkipPreamble method;\n      Fixed ReadByte usage for flags byte — replaced with ReadExactly to handle truncated files;\n      Updated README with corrected format diagram, CRC footer section, and comment parameter docs.",
